> 										235 text ACF (Điểm V cao hon UV):
> T_core = Gaussian_Intersection
> T_weak = min(Mean_UV + Std_UV, T_core)
> Mask_core = (Score >= T_core)
> Mask_weak = (Score >= T_weak)
>
> AMDF (Điểm V thap hon UV):
> T_core = Gaussian_Intersection
> T_weak = max(Mean_UV - Std_UV, T_core)
> Mask_core = (Score <= T_core)
> Mask_weak = (Score <= T_weak)
>
> Quy tac chon diem giao Gaussian_Intersection (Giai phuong trinh PDF_V(x) = PDF_UV(x)):
> - 0 nghiem: T_core = (Mean_V + Mean_UV) / 2
> - 1 nghiem: T_core = nghiem do
> - 2 nghiem: T_core = nghiem nam giua Mean_V va Mean_UV. Neu khong co hoac co ca 2 nghiem nam giua, chon nghiem gan voi (Mean_V + Mean_UV) / 2 nhat.
>
> Dieu kien block lien tuc (Continuous Block Condition):
> 1. Tim tat ca cac block (chuoi lien tiep) cac frame co gia tri 1 trong Mask_weak.
> 2. Voi moi block:
>    Neu block chua it nhat mot frame co Mask_core == 1:
>        Gan tat ca frame trong block la V (Label = 1).
>    Nguoc lai:
>        Gan tat ca frame trong block la UV (Label = 0).
>
> Quy tac Refit sau LOFO (Leave-One-File-Out):
> KHONG refit (khong tinh lai Gaussians bang cach gop 4 file training lai).
> Voi tap test doc lap, su dung trung binh cong cua 4 gia tri T_core va trung binh cong cua 4 gia tri T_weak rut ra tu 4 luot LOFO tren tap training.
